<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Temporary Password - Smart Education</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
      }
      .container {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }
      .logo {
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #667eea;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .title {
        color: #2c3e50;
        font-size: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .content {
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }
      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #5a67d8 100%);
        color: white;
        padding: 15px 30px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 20px 0;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      }
      .button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 40px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        color: #666;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .password-box {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-family: monospace;
        font-size: 16px;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 20px 0;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }
      .warning {
        background-color: #fff3cd;
        border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
        color: #856404;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="logo">🔒 Smart Education</div>
        <h1 class="title">Your Temporary Password</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi <strong><%= fullName %></strong>,</p>

        <p>
          We have generated a temporary password for your Smart Education
          account. Use the password below to sign in, then immediately change it
          from your account settings.
        </p>

        <div class="password-box">
          <strong><%= newPassword %></strong>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center">
          <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="button"
            >Sign in to Smart Education</a
          >
        </div>

        <div class="warning">
          <strong>⚠️ Security Note:</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>
              This temporary password is for one-time use. Please change it
              after signing in.
            </li>
            <li>
              If you did not request a password reset, contact our support
              immediately.
            </li>
            <li>Do not share this password with anyone.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <p>
          If you experience any issues logging in, please contact our support
          team.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>Stay Secure,<br /><strong>Smart Education Security Team</strong></p>
        <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        <p>© 2024 Smart Education. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
